sequenceDiagram
  participant U as 你
  participant H as Hortus
  participant T as 终端 agent
  participant C as hortus CLI
  U->>H: 发送当前笔记
  H->>T: 填入提示词和笔记路径
  T->>C: search 缓存策略
  C-->>T: 12 条结果
  T->>C: backlinks 04-架构笔记
  C-->>T: 5 条反链
  T->>T: 整理成 mindmap
  T->>C: mermaid check
  C-->>T: 语法通过
  T->>H: 写入 总结.md
  H-->>U: 刷新阅读视图，列出本次改动
